&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join us in building the future of finance.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to democratize finance for all. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cerulli.com/press-releases/cerulli-anticipates-124-trillion-in-wealth-will-transfer-through-2048&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;An estimated $124 trillion of assets&lt;/a&gt; will be inherited by younger generations in the next two decades. The largest transfer of wealth in human history. If you’re ready to be at the epicenter of this historic cultural and financial shift, keep reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team + role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building an elite team, applying frontier technologies to the world’s biggest financial problems. We’re looking for bold thinkers. Sharp problem-solvers. Builders who are wired to make an impact. Robinhood isn’t a place for complacency, it’s where ambitious people do the best work of their careers. We’re a high-performing, fast-moving team with ethics at the center of everything we do. Expectations are high, and so are the rewards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Robinhood is looking for a Director of Corporate Development to help accelerate our roadmap by identifying, vetting, and executing acquisitions, strategic investments, and other transactions. In this role, you will develop a deep understanding of Robinhood&#39;s strategic priorities and market landscape, and partner with GMs and senior leadership to identify high-potential opportunities across our existing and future product verticals and geographies. You will help build Robinhood&#39;s network of founders, investors, and bankers, and develop relationships that may lead to acquisitions or strategic investments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with deal sponsors and cross-functional leaders across Robinhood on all aspects of M&amp;amp;A, including business case construction, valuation analysis, deal structuring, negotiation, due diligence, execution, and post-close integration. You will present opportunities to company leadership and the Board of Directors, facilitate key decisions, and provide post-acquisition performance updates. The ideal candidate is strategic, relationship-oriented, analytical, and results-oriented, and thrives at a public company that still operates like a startup.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in our Menlo Park, CA or New York, NY offices, with in-person attendance expected 3 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze Robinhood&#39;s strategic landscape, gather competitive and industry intelligence, and develop the business case and rationale for key M&amp;amp;A opportunities, advocating for them internally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage transactions end to end, including sourcing, valuation, negotiation, diligence, and closing, and partner with integration teams to deliver a seamless post-close transition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead deal evaluation meetings and drive decision-making with objectivity, diplomacy, and effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate relationships with founders, venture capital firms, and investment banks to build a proactive pipeline of future acquisitions and strategic investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with business sponsors and leaders across Legal, Finance, Compliance, Product, and Engineering to build clear business and financial cases and execute deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present opportunities and recommendations to senior leadership and the Board of Directors, and report on post-acquisition performance against the original deal thesis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help build scalable processes, playbooks, and best practices that shape the operating system of Robinhood&#39;s Corporate Development team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in corporate development, investment banking, venture capital, private equity, or other investing roles, ideally within fintech, financial services, or consumer technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of sourcing, leading, and closing complex technology acquisitions or strategic investments, ideally including in-house corporate development experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional analytical skills, including company valuation, financial modeling, and structured problem solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to reason from first principles, using data and analysis to draw sound conclusions, with a bias toward action: analyze fast, decide, and either move forward or move on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills and a track record of building strong working relationships with founders, investors, bankers, and executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive presence and outstanding written and verbal communication, including experience presenting to senior leadership and boards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resourceful, persistent, and able to thrive in a fast-paced, entrepreneurial environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Robinhood and our industry. You enjoy managing your money on your phone!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenging, high-impact work to grow your career.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance-driven compensation with multipliers for outsized impact, bonus programs, equity ownership, and 401(k) matching.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Best-in-class benefits to fuel your work, including 100% paid health insurance for employees with 90% coverage for dependents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lifestyle wallet — a highly flexible benefits spending account for wellness, learning, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employer-paid life &amp;amp; disability insurance, fertility benefits, and mental health benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off to recharge including company holidays, paid time off, sick time, parental leave, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional office experience with catered meals, events, and comfortable workspaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In addition to the base pay range listed below, this role is also eligible for bonus opportunities + equity + benefits.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base pay for the successful applicant will depend on a variety of job-related factors, which may include education, training, experience, location, business needs, or market demands. The expected base pay range for this role is based on the location where the work will be performed and is aligned to one of 3 compensation zones. For other locations not listed, compensation can be discussed with your recruiter during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Base Pay Range:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone 1 (Menlo Park, CA; New York, NY; Bellevue, WA; Washington, DC)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$242,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$285,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone 2 (Denver, CO; Westlake, TX; Chicago, IL)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$213,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$251,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone 3 (Lake Mary, FL; Clearwater, FL; Gainesville, FL)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$189,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$222,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about our Total Rewards, which vary by region and entity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If our mission energizes you and you’re ready to build the future of finance, we look forward to seeing your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Usage Disclosure:&lt;/strong&gt; Robinhood uses artificial intelligence (AI) tools to support parts of our recruiting process. These tools enhance the efficiency and consistency of our hiring process; however, all hiring decisions are made by our hiring teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Robinhood provides equal opportunity for all applicants, offers reasonable accommodations upon request, and complies with applicable equal employment and privacy laws. Inclusion is built into how we hire and work—welcoming different backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences so everyone can do their best. Please review the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/applicantprivacypolicy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; for your country of application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The Retail Media team helps national brands connect with Hello Fresh Group’s customers via product samples, recipe integration, digital activations, brand experiences, and meal kit sponsorship. Through our network of brands, we reach tens of millions of consumers each month allowing brands to engage specific consumer segments and drive mass-scale trial, purchase conversion and authentic word of mouth conversations both online and offline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Description:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hello Fresh seeks an Senior Account Executive, Retail Media to build on the success of this unique offering and to increase sales. The ideal candidate has 5-7 years of successful sales experience working with national CPG Brands and the digital agencies that represent them for product sampling, couponing, shopper marketing, digital and trade marketing. You will act as a strategic partner to your assigned clients and sell a broad range of advertising solutions that will ensure that their business goals are met.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage all aspects of the sales process including opening and developing new business, closing add-on and incremental business, determining needs, and proposing compelling programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create strategic marketing solutions for CPG clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Augment and optimize our sales and prospecting processes leveraging Generative AI tools to grow sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop sales plan for territory to meet or exceed growth and revenue goal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong client and agency relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent HelloFresh as one of the company’s key external evangelists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-7 years years successful sales experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of meeting and exceeding renewal goals and margins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success at growing repeat business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate effectively in person, phone, and email&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using GenAI to create streamlined processes that can support sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Emotional intelligence, positive attitude, enthusiasm, high energy, attention to detail, strong follow through&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working in a fast-paced, hands-on, rapidly changing environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability/willingness to travel domestically&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BA/BS degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll get...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary, 401k with company match that vests immediately upon participation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO, including sabbatical, and parental leave of up to 16 weeks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Tuition reimbursement for continuing education (upon 2 years of service)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Access to Employee Resource Groups that are open to all employees, including those pertaining to BIPOC, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is disrupting the traditional food supply chain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Base Pay range: $101k-138k NYC/ Base Pay range: $94k-129k Illinois&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;On-Target earnings (OTE) estimated:&amp;nbsp;$160K - $288 NYC / On-Target earnings (OTE) estimated: $154k - $282k Illinois&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;This job description is intended to provide a general overview of the responsibilities. However, the Company reserves the right to adjust, modify, or reassign work tasks and responsibilities as needed to meet changing business needs, operational requirements, or other factors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;New York Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$101,430&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$138,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Illinois Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$94,815&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$129,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Brex is the intelligent finance platform that enables companies to spend smarter and move faster in more than 200 markets. By combining global corporate cards and banking with intuitive spend management, bill pay, and travel software, Brex enables founders and finance teams to accelerate operations, gain real-time visibility, and control spend effortlessly. Brex’s AI-native automation and world-class service eliminate manual expense and accounting tasks for customers so they can focus on what matters most. Tens of thousands of the world&#39;s best companies run on Brex, including DoorDash, Coinbase, Robinhood, Zoom, Plaid, Reddit, and SeatGeek.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at Brex allows you to push your limits, challenge the status quo, and collaborate with some of the brightest minds in the industry. We’re committed to building a diverse team and inclusive culture and believe your potential should only be limited by how big you can dream. We make this a reality by empowering you with the tools, resources, and support you need to grow your career.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales at Brex&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Sales team is the driving factor behind revenue for Brex and every member of our team directly affects our bottom line. We focus on generating new opportunities, acquiring new customers, and building even stronger relationships with our current customers. Our winning culture recognizes big team wins and celebrates individual accomplishments. We ensure that top performers are recognized and have built a competitive environment to motivate and unify the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Brex is hiring a Director of Revenue Operations to own the operating model for our New Business (AE and SDR) motions. You will report into the Head of Revenue Operations as a strategic leader. This role sets the coverage model, incentive architecture, and operating cadence for the teams you support, and is accountable for their overall performance. You&#39;ll manage a team of RevOps managers and individual contributors, and be the decision maker on tradeoffs between speed, rigor, and scale across your domain. This role requires someone who can move fluidly between executive-level narratives and the underlying mechanics that drive performance and coach their team to do the same.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where You&#39;ll Work&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will be based in our San Francisco office. We are a hybrid environment that combines the energy and connections of being in the office with the benefits and flexibility of working from home. We currently require a minimum of three coordinated days in the office per week, Monday, Wednesday and Thursday. As a perk, we also have up to four weeks per year of fully remote work!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a trusted business partner to the SVP Sales in owning and improving the strategies, coverage models, operating rhythms, efficiency, and incentive compensation structure to drive revenue growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead initiatives with enablement, data, finance, systems, marketing, operations, and other revenue operations team members to support your business partners and implement improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and improve upon cadences for forecasting, pipeline, capacity planning, rep productivity, territory carving, quota setting, and incentive design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop a team of 6+ supporting New Business Account Executives and Sales Development Representatives Organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present to senior leaders on business strategy, segment performance, and analytical deep dives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the annual planning process for the GTM teams you support, working closely with business partners, finance, and other teams to set the strategy, align incentives, and ensure operational excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and prioritize efficiency improvements within the Rev Ops org, including processes, reporting, and automation leveraging AI or other tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in revenue operations, sales strategy, or sales operations with at least 2+ years managing managers; preferably at a Fintech or SaaS company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for coaching and developing a team with varying levels of experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive understanding of sales funnels, processes, and methodologies in a scaled revenue organization, including with partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success operating in a complex cross functional environment to deliver impactful outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience owning incentive compensation design and coverage models for AE and SDR organizations at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem solving skills and collaborative approach to solutioning within and outside of Rev Ops&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to influence with or without authority, strong stakeholder management and executive communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience with Salesforce and other GTM systems, including examples of AI-driven efficiency improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset with the ability to quickly interpret data and quickly understand complex models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail including modeling, communication, and documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The expected salary range for this role is $258,000 - $322,000. However, the starting base pay will depend on a number of factors including the candidate’s location, skills, experience, market demands, and internal pay parity. Depending on the position offered, equity and other forms of compensation may be provided as part of a total compensation package.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please be aware, job-seekers may be at risk of targeting by malicious actors looking for personal data. Brex recruiters will only reach out via LinkedIn or email with a&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;http://brex.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://brex.com&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;brex.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;domain. Any outreach claiming to be from Brex via other sources should be ignored.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join us in building the future of finance.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to democratize finance for all. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cerulli.com/press-releases/cerulli-anticipates-124-trillion-in-wealth-will-transfer-through-2048&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;An estimated $124 trillion of assets&lt;/a&gt; will be inherited by younger generations in the next two decades. The largest transfer of wealth in human history. If you’re ready to be at the epicenter of this historic cultural and financial shift, keep reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM + ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building an elite team, applying frontier technologies to the world&#39;s biggest financial problems. We&#39;re looking for bold thinkers. Sharp problem-solvers. Builders who are wired to make an impact. Robinhood isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it&#39;s where ambitious people do the best work of their careers. We&#39;re a high-performing, fast-moving team with ethics at the center of everything we do. Expectations are high, and so are the rewards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The AI Platform &amp;amp; Agentic Apps team builds the agent platform behind every AI agent at Robinhood — today giving a growing number of engineers and employees an AI teammate that ships code, queries data, and runs operational workflows on their behalf. We&#39;re building toward the same platform powering the agents millions of customers interact with directly, in real time. These agents don&#39;t just answer questions; they&#39;re designed to take real action across carefully curated meta harnesses. This is agentic AI at real scale, in a regulated financial environment, and it will change how Robinhood works. We move fast, raise the bar, and care deeply about building things that matter!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Engineering Manager, you will lead the charge in developing critical infrastructure for Agentic applications spanning Robinhood products. You will guide the engineering organization in leveraging Large Language Models (LLMs) to create real, scalable products that act in the world on behalf of Robinhood&#39;s customers and employees. This role calls for a visionary leader with a strong software engineering background, a passion for developing platforms, and deep expertise in applied ML at scale. You&#39;ll partner closely with Legal, Compliance, and Security to build agents that can be trusted to act in a regulated brokerage environment — driving everything from eval-gated releases to audit trails that hold up under scrutiny.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in our &lt;strong&gt;Menlo Park, CA&lt;/strong&gt; office, with in-person attendance expected 5 days per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Build and lead the team behind Robinhood&#39;s agentic applications — hire and grow strong engineers, and own the roadmap and delivery bar for agents that act for millions of customers and for employees internally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Set technical direction on agent orchestration, tool integration, evals, and permissioning for consequential actions — deep enough to change a design, not only approve it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Make agents trustworthy enough to act in a regulated brokerage: build eval-gated releases, guardrails and approval flows for money-moving actions, and audit trails alongside Legal, Compliance, and Security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Own production reliability for nondeterministic systems running on third-party model providers: SLOs, fallbacks, and incidents driven through to fixed root causes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Define and move the metrics that matter — task completion, quality, latency, cost per task — and report progress to leadership in numbers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• 10+ years managing software engineers, with a record of hiring well, growing people, and shipping products used at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Hands-on depth in LLM systems — you&#39;ve shipped tool-calling agents to production and can critique an architecture or eval plan yourself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience running consumer-scale production services: SLOs, on-call, and dependencies you don&#39;t control.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Judgment in ambiguous, fast-moving spaces — you turn conflicting input into a focused roadmap with measurable goals, and cut scope to hit them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Direct, clear communication with engineers, product, and executives; you write well and earn trust across functions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LEADERSHIP EXPECTATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ambitious roadmap requires a great culture shaped by exceptional leaders. Here&#39;s what we expect from them:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Drive high performance by setting clear, focused goals, giving real-time feedback, stretching top talent, and scaling impact through focus, innovation, and tech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Hire and retain top talent by setting a high bar, hiring only those who raise it, investing in onboarding, and addressing talent issues quickly and fairly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Create community by connecting work to purpose, removing friction while prioritizing safety, building trust and inclusion, and leading from the front with integrity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Challenging, high-impact work to grow your career&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Performance driven compensation with multipliers for outsized impact, bonus programs, equity ownership, and 401(k) matching&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Top Tier benefits to fuel your work, including 100% paid health insurance for employees with 90% coverage for dependents&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Access to the Robinhood Employee Fund that gives eligible US employees the opportunity to invest in a private employee fund that provides exposure to Robinhood Ventures funds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Access to the best AI tools on the market and continuous AI skill-building for every employee, technical or not.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Lifestyle wallet - a highly flexible benefits spending account for wellness, learning, and more&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Employer-paid life &amp;amp; disability insurance, fertility benefits, and mental health benefits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Time off to recharge including company holidays, paid time off, sick time, parental leave, and more!&lt;/p&gt;
